Package: x-sidechain
Version: @VERSION@
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11)
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Maintainer: gsmarcil <marcil.rachid@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/gsmarcil/X-SIDECHAIN
Description: evidence-first multi-agent deliberation for Linux
 X-SIDECHAIN runs a chaired deliberation between AI agents hosted by
 different providers. Each agent works in a private workspace, publishes a
 bounded public brief, answers the chair's clarifications, and reviews the
 chair's draft.
 .
 Every session is bounded before it starts and every public event is written
 to a hash-chained audit log that can be verified afterwards. A local
 interface, served on the loopback address behind a one-off token, shows the
 deliberation as it happens.
 .
 The package needs no libraries beyond the Python standard library.
